# Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS (text-to-speech) preview

{% callout type="note" %}
  `gemini-3.1-flash-tts-preview` is a legacy preview model. For new and
  production workloads, migrate to
  [Gemini 3.8 Flash TTS](/docs/models/gemini-3.8-flash-tts)
  (`gemini-3.8-flash-tts`) or
  [Gemini 3.8 Flash-Lite TTS](/docs/models/gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts)
  (`gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts`). See the
  [migration guide](/docs/speech-generation#migration).

{% /callout %}

The Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS Preview model provides powerful, low-latency speech
generation with natural outputs, steerable prompts, and expressive audio
tags for precise narration control.

{% button href="https://aistudio.google.com?model=gemini-3.1-flash-tts-preview" variant="ais" %}Try in Google AI Studio{% /button %}

## Documentation  {% id="documentation" %}

The Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS Preview model introduces expressive [audio tags](/docs/speech-generation#controllable)
for controlling narration, as well as overall improvements to naturalness,
controllability, and multilinguality.

Visit the [Text-to-Speech](/docs/speech-generation) guide for full
coverage of features and capabilities.

